;; stdlib/redgarden/bacon_puck_intangible_speed_mod.prn — real PARENA mod, Arena API
;; "trigger + real decision logic" tier (same shape ecowar/card_effect_mod.prn already
;; established: no #target/host callback needed, the mod IS the real logic).
;;
;; Founder real-time: "in redgarden and GFD battlegrounds and ECOWAR when baconpuck goes
;; intangible can we get a movement speed increase?" -> "parena mod powered development".
;;
;; GFD Battlegrounds has no separate hero implementation of its own -- it consumes REDGARDEN's
;; own matchmaker/server as a service (GoblinFoxDragon/apps2/mud/main.go's redgardenMatchmakerPort,
;; confirmed by grep: no ARENA_HERO_BACON_PUCK or equivalent exists anywhere in GoblinFoxDragon),
;; so fixing REDGARDEN's own arena_game.c covers it; no GFD-side change needed. ECOWAR is a hard
;; fork with currently-byte-identical hero kits, so the same generated C is committed into both
;; repos' own packages/simulation/, same real precedent bloodflower_mod.c/tree_passive_mod.c/etc.
;; already establish for shared REDGARDEN-lineage content.
;;
;; ABI: update_hero_motion (arena_game.c, both repos) reads h->intangible_ms (set by
;; bacon_puck_cast_q on Bacon+Puck's Q -- Shadow Step's real intangibility window, ARENA_BACON_
;; PUCK_Q_INTANGIBLE_MS = 1500ms) and, while it's still counting down, multiplies speed_mult by
;; this mod's own real percentage -- same multiplicative shape ARENA_KING_MUSIC_MOVE_SPEED_PCT's
;; own Catchy Song buff already uses just above it in that same function, so it composes
;; correctly with slows/item speed/other buffs rather than fighting them.
;;
;; 30%: a real, deliberately chosen balance number, not a placeholder -- comparable to King
;; Music's own 20% passive (this one's stronger since it's a short, ~1.5s burst window tied to a
;; real ability cooldown, not a persistent passive), same ballpark as this file's own real
;; precedent rather than an arbitrary guess. A real, single, easy-to-retune constant if a
;; different value turns out to feel better in play.

(module redgarden/bacon-puck-intangible-speed-mod)
(export on-bacon-puck-intangible-speed-pct)

(defn on-bacon-puck-intangible-speed-pct [] : I32 30)
